SUMMARY:Pumpkin Patch Express at Wales West Light Railway
DESCRIPTION:A steam locomotive named Dame Ann carries riders to a pumpkin 
 patch and an optional spooky maze at Wales West in Silverhill. Before 7:0
 0 PM the ride is the kid-friendly day train\, and after 7:00 PM it become
 s the Scary Night Train. Each guest gets a free pumpkin\, and the ticket 
 also covers mini train rides\, a hayride\, a bounce house and mini golf.\
